    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Aurora Innovation, Inc. describes itself as a developer of self-driving freight technology. Its website uses the tagline \"Self-driving. Game-changing.\" and presents the Aurora Driver as a system built with hardware and software backed by verifiable AI, intended to integrate autonomy into trucking fleets. The site includes statements from partners about a pilot hauling freight between Fort Worth and El Paso and integration with the Volvo VNL Autonomous. It also cites a projection that freight volumes will grow five fold between 2010 and 2050.\n\nThe company's main described product is the Aurora Driver, an autonomous driving system for freight. No additional product entries are listed in the accompanying data. Aurora Innovation, Inc. is a for-profit public company headquartered in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, trading under the ticker AUR. Its SEC Central Index Key is 0001828108. No litigation cases are listed, and the company has a Pennsylvania law exposure count of 155.",
